  "content": "\n\n<p>地圖版本：1.12</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這只是一座擁有火山與 10 棟小型建築的島嶼。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>這是一張搭配模組整合包的地圖。建議安裝以下模組整合包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/survival-on-zombie-island\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡 (Survival on Zombie Island)</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>地圖介紹：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://upload.cc/i1/2021/05/16/wfJXEc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
